    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/37dd2da3e41dc2699b75756dd9a463f9.avif?t=1755275288\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/0a92ca3f01cffa2b0dfb6da634e84a92.poster.avif?t=1755275288\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/0a92ca3f01cffa2b0dfb6da634e84a92.webm?t=1755275288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/0a92ca3f01cffa2b0dfb6da634e84a92.mp4?t=1755275288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way out is through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as a quiet night camping with friends has become a found-footage nightmare. Military jets roar overhead. A distant siren cuts through the silence. Drawn to a seemingly abandoned bunker for safety, the doors slam shut behind you. Now, you are trapped in the dark, forced to navigate the decaying corridors, uncover the truth behind a long-forgotten experiment, and survive the horrors lurking within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bunker is a short PSX-style, VHS horror experience (~60 mins)\u00a0 that blurs the line between reality and nightmare. Grainy, distorted visuals, realistic first-person movement, and an oppressive atmosphere pull you into an immersive psychological horror experience. Every flicker of your flashlight could reveal something you wish you hadn\u2019t seen. Cryptic notes line the walls, remnants of a failed experiment\u2014and something else is still lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the bunker\u2019s secrets, survive its horrors, and discover the fate of your friends?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/5a6adf13f7471783c410cc960716cbee.avif?t=1755275288\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/68dcf61fb930866f7df76f7c0fd39df7.poster.avif?t=1755275288\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/68dcf61fb930866f7df76f7c0fd39df7.webm?t=1755275288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/68dcf61fb930866f7df76f7c0fd39df7.mp4?t=1755275288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Horror Aesthetic:</strong> Distorted visuals, analog grain, and eerie found-footage presentation heighten the fear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Perspective</strong>: Realistic camera movement pulls you deeper into the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Dark Experiment:</strong> Cryptic messages, unsettling remnants, and a growing sense of unease drive the mystery\u00a0 The Bunker keeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Atmospheric Sound Design</strong>: Echoing footsteps, distant whispers, and unsettling silence keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: The terror isn't just what you see\u2014it\u2019s what you think is there.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/37dd2da3e41dc2699b75756dd9a463f9.avif?t=1755275288\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/0a92ca3f01cffa2b0dfb6da634e84a92.poster.avif?t=1755275288\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/0a92ca3f01cffa2b0dfb6da634e84a92.webm?t=1755275288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/0a92ca3f01cffa2b0dfb6da634e84a92.mp4?t=1755275288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only way out is through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What started as a quiet night camping with friends has become a found-footage nightmare. Military jets roar overhead. A distant siren cuts through the silence. Drawn to a seemingly abandoned bunker for safety, the doors slam shut behind you. Now, you are trapped in the dark, forced to navigate the decaying corridors, uncover the truth behind a long-forgotten experiment, and survive the horrors lurking within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bunker is a short PSX-style, VHS horror experience (~60 mins)\u00a0 that blurs the line between reality and nightmare. Grainy, distorted visuals, realistic first-person movement, and an oppressive atmosphere pull you into an immersive psychological horror experience. Every flicker of your flashlight could reveal something you wish you hadn\u2019t seen. Cryptic notes line the walls, remnants of a failed experiment\u2014and something else is still lurking in the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you unravel the bunker\u2019s secrets, survive its horrors, and discover the fate of your friends?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/5a6adf13f7471783c410cc960716cbee.avif?t=1755275288\" width=616 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/68dcf61fb930866f7df76f7c0fd39df7.poster.avif?t=1755275288\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/68dcf61fb930866f7df76f7c0fd39df7.webm?t=1755275288\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3487660/extras/68dcf61fb930866f7df76f7c0fd39df7.mp4?t=1755275288\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Horror Aesthetic:</strong> Distorted visuals, analog grain, and eerie found-footage presentation heighten the fear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive First-Person Perspective</strong>: Realistic camera movement pulls you deeper into the nightmare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a Dark Experiment:</strong> Cryptic messages, unsettling remnants, and a growing sense of unease drive the mystery\u00a0 The Bunker keeps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Atmospheric Sound Design</strong>: Echoing footsteps, distant whispers, and unsettling silence keep you on edge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong>: The terror isn't just what you see\u2014it\u2019s what you think is there.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Trapped in an abandoned bunker, you are alone\u2014your friends locked out, something else locked in. This PSX, VHS-style found-footage psychological horror plunges you into a nightmare of analog terror. Will you unravel the truth, survive the bunker\u2019s horrors, and discover the fate of your friends?",
